# Conformal cross-check oracle (added 2026-07-13).
# MAPIE (Model Agnostic Prediction Interval Estimator) is used ONLY as an independent
# reference in tests/conformal/test_mapie_crosscheck.py -- never in the pipeline. It was
# declared in NO requirements file, so that test had NEVER EXECUTED on any machine. Installed
# and run 2026-07-13: all 3 tests PASS. Our from-scratch LAC (Least Ambiguous set-valued
# Classifier) sets match MAPIE element-wise EXACTLY, and our APS (Adaptive Prediction Sets) is
# confirmed a valid, tighter variant rather than a bug. The test targets the MAPIE 1.x API
# (mapie.classification.SplitConformalClassifier), hence the >=1.4 floor.
